      "excerpt": "\"Stealin'\" is a song by British hard rock band Uriah Heep, from the concept album Sweet Freedom. The song was written by Ken Hensley, and it reached gold status in New Zealand. The B-side of the song is \"Sunshine\".\n\n\nPersonnel\nDavid Byron – vocals\nMick Box – guitars\nKen Hensley – keyboard\nLee Kerslake – drums\nGary Thain – bass\n\n\nChart performance\n\n\nReferences",
